  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result of Section 2.**\n- **L=1.** $\\Delta_1=\\Delta_2=0$, so $t_a(u)^\\dagger=\\bar t_a(u)$. For real parameters, the $t$'s are then Hermitian and commute with their conjugates. (Off-diagonal terms enter $t_2$ only as $E_{ji}E_{ij}$, and that combination is self-conjugate.)\n- **L=2.**\n$$\\Delta_1=t_1^\\dagger-\\bar t_1=\\bar h^2\\sum_{i\\ne k}(\\bar z_k-\\bar z_i)\\,E^{(1)}_{ik}E^{(2)}_{ki}.$$\n  Conjugation swaps which $z$ weights the two-site hopping term, so $t_1^\\dagger$ is not $\\bar t_1$ unless the $z$'s are equal. $\\Delta_2$ has 240 terms.\n\n## 3. $[t_1(u),t_1(v)^\\dagger]$ at L=2\nWrite $H_s=\\sum_iz_iE^{(s)}_{ii}$, $J=H_1+H_2$, and $C_z=\\sum_{i,k}z_iE^{(1)}_{ik}E^{(2)}_{ki}$. Then\n$$t_1(u)=c(u)+hu\\,J-h(\\theta_2H_1+\\theta_1H_2)+h^2C_z.$$\nFor real parameters, $t_1(v)^\\dagger$ is the same expression with $C_z\\to C_z^\\dagger=\\sum_{i,k}z_kE^{(1)}_{ik}E^{(2)}_{ki}$. $J$ commutes with $C_z$, $C_z^\\dagger$ and the $H_s$, and $[H_2,E^{(1)}_{ik}E^{(2)}_{ki}]=(z_k-z_i)E^{(1)}_{ik}E^{(2)}_{ki}$. So, with $\\theta_{12}=\\theta_1-\\theta_2$ and independent of $u$ and $v$,\n$$[t_1(u),t_1(v)^\\dagger]=-h^3\\theta_{12}\\sum_{i,k}(z_i-z_k)^2E^{(1)}_{ik}E^{(2)}_{ki}+h^4\\,[C_z,C_z^\\dagger].$$\nThe cell checks this identity against the brute-force commutator and then examines $[C_z,C_z^\\dagger]$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Hs[s_] := Sum[z[i] nc[gen[s, i, i]], {i, 3}];\nCz = normal[Sum[z[i] nc[gen[1, i, k], gen[2, k, i]], {i, 3}, {k, 3}]];\nCzDag = normal[dag[Cz] /. zb[i_] :> z[i]];\nchecks3 = <||>;\nchecks3[\"Cz^dag = Σ z_k E1_ik E2_ki\"] = normal[CzDag - Sum[z[k] nc[gen[1, i, k], gen[2, k, i]], {i, 3}, {k, 3}]] === 0;\nC11 = comm[t1[2][u], dag[t1[2][v]]];\nC11r = normal[C11 /. {hb -> h, θb[s_] :> θ[s], zb[i_] :> z[i], vb -> v}];\nCCd = comm[Cz, CzDag];\nchecks3[\"[t1(u),t1(v)^dag] = -h^3 θ12 Σ(z_i-z_k)^2 E1_ik E2_ki + h^4 [Cz,Cz^dag]\"] = normal[C11r - (-h^3 (θ[1] - θ[2]) Sum[(z[i] - z[k])^2 nc[gen[1, i, k], gen[2, k, i]], {i, 3}, {k, 3}] + h^4 CCd)] === 0;\nbyLen[e_, n_] := Total[Select[terms[e], Length[First[Cases[{#}, _nc, Infinity, 1]]] == n &]];\nchecks3[\"[Cz,Cz^dag] has cubic (3-generator) words\"] = byLen[CCd, 3] =!= 0;\nchecks3[\"untwisted (all z equal): [t1,t1^dag] = 0\"] = normal[C11r /. z[_] -> 1] === 0;\nchecks3[\"z1 = z2 != z3: [t1,t1^dag] = 0?\"] = normal[C11r /. z[2] -> z[1]] === 0;\nchecks3[\"unitary twist zb = 1/z: [t1,t1^dag] = 0?\"] = normal[C11 /. {hb -> h, θb[s_] :> θ[s], zb[i_] :> 1/z[i], vb -> v}] === 0;\nGrid[Prepend[KeyValueMap[{#1, #2} &, checks3], {\"statement\", \"value\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
